---
title: "lifecycle (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: initialize(saleInitParams, fixedPriceSaleInitParams)
    q_init --> q_prefund: Prefund period (signature-gated)
    q_prefund --> q_allocPeriod: Prefund allocation period (no new invest)
    q_allocPeriod --> q_open: Open investment period (no signature needed)
    q_open --> q_ended: end() by LegionOrProject
    q_open --> q_canceled: cancel() by Project
    q_ended --> q_refundWindow: Refund period starts
    q_refundWindow --> q_refundOver: block.timestamp >= endTime + refundDuration
    q_refundOver --> q_publishResults: publishSaleResults() by Legion
    q_publishResults --> q_claimable: Investors claim via Merkle proof
    q_claimable --> q_withdrawCapital: withdrawRaisedCapital() by Project
    q_withdrawCapital --> [*]: Complete
    q_canceled --> q_refundAll: withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled()
    q_refundAll --> [*]: All capital returned

    note right of q_prefund
        INV-001: Prefund period 1h to 12w, allocation period 1w to 2w
        INV-002: During prefund, signature required from legionSigner
    end note

    note right of q_publishResults
        INV-003: publishSaleResults sets claimMerkleRoot and acceptedMerkleRoot
        INV-004: totalCapitalRaised = tokensAllocated * tokenPrice / 10^decimals
    end note
